{"id":"vd-b1-the-old-factory","level":"b1","n":22,"title":{"en":"What Was It Like Back Then?","vi":"Hồi đó thế nào hả ông?"},"summary":"Máy quay bật lên; Sofia phỏng vấn ông nội về những năm làm ở nhà máy Hartley — tiếng ồn, những ký hiệu tay và ban nhạc kèn đồng.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-old-factory","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Old Factory","vi":"Nhà máy cũ"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"camera","x":820}]},"cast":{"sofia":{"name":{"en":"Sofia","vi":"Sofia"},"look":"teengirl","x":540,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#3A2A22","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#16A085","topShade":"#12876F"}},"luca":{"name":{"en":"Grandpa Luca","vi":"Ông Luca"},"look":"grandpa","x":1140,"style":{"outfit":"cardigan","top":"#7B5E3B","topShade":"#654D31"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"sofia","en":"OK, the camera's on. Grandpa, when did you start working at the mill?","vi":"Được rồi, máy quay bật rồi. Ông ơi, ông bắt đầu làm ở nhà máy khi nào ạ?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ðə","ˈkæmɹəz","ɑn","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","wɛn","dɪd","ju","stɑɹt","ˈwɝkɪŋ","æt","ðə","mɪl"],"start":0.554,"end":6.024,"gesture":"explain","prop":"camera","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.238],[2,1.369],[3,1.915],[4,3.194],[5,4.079],[6,4.274],[7,4.457],[8,4.587],[9,4.964],[10,5.407],[11,5.55],[12,5.654]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"In 1957. I was fifteen.","vi":"Năm 1957. Ông mười lăm tuổi.","ipa":["ɪn","","aɪ","wɑz","fɪfˈtin"],"start":6.814,"end":10.454,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.814],[2,9.263],[3,9.453],[4,9.725]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"What was it like inside?","vi":"Bên trong như thế nào ạ?","ipa":["wʌt","wɑz","ɪt","laɪk","ˌɪnˈsaɪd"],"start":11.244,"end":12.654,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,11.244],[1,11.44],[2,11.635],[3,11.791],[4,12.065]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"Hot, dusty and incredibly loud. Hundreds of machines were running all day.","vi":"Nóng, bụi và ồn kinh khủng. Hàng trăm cỗ máy chạy suốt cả ngày.","ipa":["hɑt","ˈdʌsti","ənd","ˌɪnˈkɹɛdəbli","laʊd","ˈhʌndɹədz","ʌv","məˈʃinz","wɝ","ˈɹʌnɪŋ","ɔl","deɪ"],"start":13.444,"end":19.384,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,13.444],[1,14.066],[2,14.99],[3,15.166],[4,15.764],[5,17.007],[6,17.456],[7,17.551],[8,18.081],[9,18.285],[10,18.652],[11,18.978]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"How did you talk to each other with all that noise?","vi":"Với ngần ấy tiếng ồn, mọi người nói chuyện với nhau bằng cách nào ạ?","ipa":["haʊ","dɪd","ju","tɔk","tu","itʃ","ˈʌðɚ","wɪð","ɔl","ðæt","nɔɪz"],"start":20.174,"end":22.824,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,20.174],[1,20.34],[2,20.523],[3,20.666],[4,21.018],[5,21.161],[6,21.356],[7,21.682],[8,21.864],[9,22.085],[10,22.307]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"We used to talk with our hands. Look, this means \"tea break.\"","vi":"Bọn ông từng nói chuyện bằng tay. Nhìn này, cái này nghĩa là \"nghỉ uống trà\".","ipa":["wi","just","tu","tɔk","wɪð","ˈaʊɚ","hændz","lʊk","ðɪs","minz","ti","bɹeɪk"],"start":23.614,"end":28.584,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,23.614],[1,23.746],[2,24.004],[3,24.113],[4,24.493],[5,24.67],[6,24.833],[7,26.158],[8,26.728],[9,26.986],[10,27.976],[11,28.193]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"That's amazing! Did you use to work long hours?","vi":"Tuyệt quá! Ngày xưa ông có phải làm nhiều giờ không ạ?","ipa":["ðæts","əˈmeɪzɪŋ","dɪd","ju","jus","tu","wɝk","lɔŋ","ˈaʊɚz"],"start":29.374,"end":33.414,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,29.374],[1,29.618],[2,31.312],[3,31.534],[4,31.703],[5,32.016],[6,32.159],[7,32.497],[8,32.823]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"Ten hours a day, six days a week. We didn't use to complain much.","vi":"Mười tiếng mỗi ngày, sáu ngày mỗi tuần. Bọn ông cũng chẳng mấy khi than phiền.","ipa":["tɛn","ˈaʊɚz","ə","deɪ","sɪks","deɪz","ə","wik","wi","ˈdɪdənt","jus","tu","kəmˈpleɪn","mʌtʃ"],"start":34.204,"end":39.464,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,34.204],[1,34.441],[2,34.808],[3,34.903],[4,35.786],[5,36.18],[6,36.492],[7,36.588],[8,37.709],[9,37.885],[10,38.198],[11,38.429],[12,38.565],[13,39.04]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"Were there any good times?","vi":"Có những ngày vui không ạ?","ipa":["wɝ","ðɛɹ","ˈɛni","ɡʊd","taɪmz"],"start":40.254,"end":41.704,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,40.254],[1,40.384],[2,40.619],[3,40.853],[4,41.101]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"Oh, many. I used to play in the brass band.","vi":"Ồ, nhiều lắm. Ông từng chơi trong ban nhạc kèn đồng.","ipa":["oʊ","ˈmɛni","aɪ","just","tu","pleɪ","ɪn","ðə","bɹæs","bænd"],"start":42.494,"end":45.854,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,42.494],[1,42.711],[2,43.914],[3,44.077],[4,44.376],[5,44.511],[6,44.837],[7,44.933],[8,45.055],[9,45.422]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"And every summer, we would all go to the seaside together.","vi":"Và mùa hè nào mọi người cũng cùng nhau đi biển.","ipa":["ənd","ˈɛvɚi","ˈsʌmɚ","wi","wʊd","ɔl","ɡoʊ","tu","ðə","ˈsiˌsaɪd","təˈɡɛðɚ"],"start":46.394,"end":50.044,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,46.394],[1,46.549],[2,46.875],[3,47.731],[4,47.881],[5,48.057],[6,48.438],[7,48.696],[8,48.818],[9,48.968],[10,49.525]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"The whole factory?","vi":"Cả nhà máy luôn ạ?","ipa":["ðə","hoʊl","ˈfæktɚi"],"start":50.834,"end":51.934,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,50.834],[1,50.915],[2,51.228]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"The whole factory. The mill closed for a week. It was a real community.","vi":"Cả nhà máy. Nhà máy nghỉ một tuần. Đó thật sự là một cộng đồng.","ipa":["ðə","hoʊl","ˈfæktɚi","ðə","mɪl","kloʊzd","fɔɹ","ə","wik","ɪt","wɑz","ə","ɹil","kəˈmjunəti"],"start":52.724,"end":58.134,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,52.724],[1,52.791],[2,53.05],[3,54.442],[4,54.592],[5,54.85],[6,55.312],[7,55.462],[8,55.57],[9,56.714],[10,56.877],[11,57.081],[12,57.176],[13,57.462]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"Do you remember the strike in 1972?","vi":"Ông có nhớ cuộc đình công năm 1972 không ạ?","ipa":["du","ju","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","ðə","stɹaɪk","ɪn",""],"start":58.924,"end":61.784,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,58.924],[1,59.002],[2,59.185],[3,59.705],[4,59.823],[5,60.291]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"I remember it very well. The women stopped working first.","vi":"Ông nhớ rất rõ. Các chị em ngừng làm trước tiên.","ipa":["aɪ","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","ɪt","ˈvɛɹi","wɛl","ðə","ˈwɪmən","stɑpt","ˈwɝkɪŋ","fɝst"],"start":62.574,"end":66.644,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,62.574],[1,62.682],[2,63.131],[3,63.239],[4,63.565],[5,64.741],[6,64.904],[7,65.311],[8,65.746],[9,66.154]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"How did you feel when they went on strike?","vi":"Ông cảm thấy thế nào khi họ đình công ạ?","ipa":["haʊ","dɪd","ju","fil","wɛn","ðeɪ","wɛnt","ɑn","stɹaɪk"],"start":67.434,"end":69.684,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,67.434],[1,67.626],[2,67.821],[3,67.991],[4,68.394],[5,68.59],[6,68.759],[7,69.045],[8,69.267]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"At first, I thought they were wrong. I'm ashamed of that now.","vi":"Lúc đầu, ông nghĩ họ sai. Giờ ông thấy xấu hổ về điều đó.","ipa":["æt","fɝst","aɪ","θɔt","ðeɪ","wɝ","ɹɔŋ","aɪm","əˈʃeɪmd","ʌv","ðæt","naʊ"],"start":70.474,"end":74.954,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,70.474],[1,70.633],[2,71.516],[3,71.652],[4,71.992],[5,72.141],[6,72.345],[7,73.534],[8,73.751],[9,74.213],[10,74.295],[11,74.553]]},{"speaker":"sofia","en":"What changed your mind?","vi":"Điều gì khiến ông đổi ý ạ?","ipa":["wʌt","tʃeɪndʒd","jɔɹ","maɪnd"],"start":75.744,"end":77.084,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,75.744],[1,75.966],[2,76.447],[3,76.591]]},{"speaker":"luca","en":"Mrs. Walsh. She stood on a box and spoke for an hour. By the end, we all joined them.","vi":"Bà Walsh. Bà ấy đứng trên một chiếc thùng và nói suốt một tiếng. Đến cuối, tất cả bọn ông đều tham gia cùng.","ipa":["ˈmɪsɪz","wɔlʃ","ʃi","stʊd","ɑn","ə","bɑks","ənd","spoʊk","fɔɹ","æn","ˈaʊɚ","baɪ","ðə","ɛnd","wi","ɔl","dʒɔɪnd","ðɛm"],"start":77.874,"end":85.434,"expression":"happy","react":{"sofia":"surprised"},"timing":[[0,77.874],[1,78.223],[2,79.507],[3,79.779],[4,80.092],[5,80.214],[6,80.323],[7,81.083],[8,81.26],[9,81.708],[10,81.871],[11,81.994],[12,83.206],[13,83.41],[14,83.505],[15,84.225],[16,84.469],[17,84.782],[18,85.176]]}],"words":[{"id":"remember","en":"remember","ipa":"ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ","vi":"nhớ; ghi nhớ; nhớ lại","level":0},{"id":"noise","en":"noise","ipa":"nɔɪz","vi":"tiếng ồn; tạp âm","level":0},{"id":"factory","en":"factory","ipa":"ˈfæktɚi","vi":"nhà máy; xí nghiệp","level":0},{"id":"community","en":"community","ipa":"kəˈmjunəti","vi":"cộng đồng; khu dân cư; giới, nhóm","level":3},{"id":"brass","en":"brass","ipa":"bɹæs","vi":"đồng thau; kèn đồng","level":2},{"id":"strike","en":"strike","ipa":"stɹaɪk","vi":"đánh, đập; đình công; giáng vào","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Phỏng vấn về quá khứ: \"used to\" và \"would\"","pattern":"What was it like…? · Did you use to…? · We used to… · Every summer, we would… · I remember… · How did you feel when…?","explain":"\"Used to + động từ\" nói thói quen/tình trạng trong quá khứ nay không còn: \"We used to work twelve hours a day.\" Câu hỏi: \"Did you use to…?\" (không có -d). \"Would\" cũng dùng cho hành động lặp lại trong quá khứ: \"Every summer, we would go to the seaside.\" Mở lời phỏng vấn: \"What was it like…?\".","keys":["what was it like","did you use to","we used to","we would","i remember","how did you feel"],"lines":[2,5,6,10,14,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-old-factory.mp3","v":"34a03c1f06","duration":86.52,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}